{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>You have abused me.</b> As its Targum renders — a term of disgrace and contempt." "<b>If only there were a sword in my hand.</b> This matter was a great disgrace in the eyes of the princes — this one who goes to destroy an entire nation with his mouth, yet for this she-ass needs a weapon!"], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:14.833314394Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}